ASTRA builds:

mod/
    feqis/ fnc/ for/ nbi/ sbr/

lib/
    libfeqis.a libfnc.a libfor.a libnbi.a libsbr.a

Other modules like SPIDER, TGLF, QuaLiKiZ, QlkNN, json, NEO are precompiled and shared among users on a given platform, with several versions.
The user can choose the version in $AWS/exe/astra_rc
